# The question set's lock file is config rather than output. The blanket
# rule above keeps `final_results.json` and the rest of the extraction out
# of the repository, which stays; this one file is the pin that this project
# and the two beside it all test against, so it has to be tracked.
!config/modalities/*.lock.json
